%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e605fe7793633b8488c9feb2620d9c31, type: 3}
  m_Name: Backlog
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Capacity: 50
  data:
    Lines:
    - Text: "There must be a reason it\u2019s so cryptic, apart from making my life
        harder\u2026"
      CharFirstName: Damon
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.75686276, b: 0.98039216, a: 1}
    - Text: "Was it to disguise damning information? That\u2019s the only reason
        I can think of."
      CharFirstName: Damon
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.75686276, b: 0.98039216, a: 1}
    - Text: "I wonder why I was chosen to receive this blackmail, anyway\u2026"
      CharFirstName: Damon
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.75686276, b: 0.98039216, a: 1}
    - Text: ...
      CharFirstName: Damon
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.75686276, b: 0.98039216, a: 1}
    - Text: "Maybe\u2026I should find Tozu and ask. "
      CharFirstName: Damon
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.75686276, b: 0.98039216, a: 1}
    - Text: 'He has to be hiding around here somewhere, right? '
      CharFirstName: Damon
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.75686276, b: 0.98039216, a: 1}
    - Text: With how quickly he seems to appear and disappear, he must have his own
        way of navigating this building.
      CharFirstName: Damon
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.75686276, b: 0.98039216, a: 1}
    - Text: "A way that\u2019s hidden from the students\u2026"
      CharFirstName: Damon
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.75686276, b: 0.98039216, a: 1}
    - Text: As I mulled over the possibilities in my head, I prepared breakfast and
        returned to my room.
      CharFirstName: Damon
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.75686276, b: 0.98039216, a: 1}
    - Text: "Tozu\u2019s hideout... Where could it be?"
      CharFirstName: Damon
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.75686276, b: 0.98039216, a: 1}
    - Text: "That PIN pad in the pharmacy is definitely suspicious, but it's useless
        to me if I don't know the code\u2026"
      CharFirstName: Damon
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.75686276, b: 0.98039216, a: 1}
    - Text: "I *could* break a rule to get Tozu\u2019s attention, but then I'd risk
        getting shot by his accomplice."
      CharFirstName: Damon
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.75686276, b: 0.98039216, a: 1}
    - Text: So...what else am I supposed to do?
      CharFirstName: Damon
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.75686276, b: 0.98039216, a: 1}
    - Text: "Think, Damon, think... A way to communicate with Tozu\u2026"
      CharFirstName: Damon
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.75686276, b: 0.98039216, a: 1}
    - Text: ...There's got to be something I've missed here...
      CharFirstName: Damon
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.75686276, b: 0.98039216, a: 1}
    - Text: "The security camera\u2026"
      CharFirstName: Damon
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.75686276, b: 0.98039216, a: 1}
    - Text: "Wait\u2026could that be it?"
      CharFirstName: Damon
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.75686276, b: 0.98039216, a: 1}
    - Text: While I may not be able to see Tozu...
      CharFirstName: Damon
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.75686276, b: 0.98039216, a: 1}
    - Text: ...he should be able to <gradient="HitText">see me</gradient>.
      CharFirstName: Damon
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.75686276, b: 0.98039216, a: 1}
    - Text: Which means, this camera...
      CharFirstName: Damon
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.75686276, b: 0.98039216, a: 1}
    - Text: Yes, this camera is how I can communicate!
      CharFirstName: Damon
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.75686276, b: 0.98039216, a: 1}
    - Text: I grabbed a sticky note and pen from the desk and scribbled a message.
      CharFirstName: Damon
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.75686276, b: 0.98039216, a: 1}
    - Text: '"To Tozu,'
      CharFirstName: Damon
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.75686276, b: 0.98039216, a: 1}
    - Text: "I have questions about the murder motive. Let\u2019s meet in the boiler
        room at 8:10 p.m. tonight."
      CharFirstName: Damon
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.75686276, b: 0.98039216, a: 1}
    - Text: " \u2014 Damon Maitsu.\""
      CharFirstName: Damon
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.75686276, b: 0.98039216, a: 1}
    - Text: Using the desk chair as a stool, I stuck the note to the camera lens.
      CharFirstName: Damon
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.75686276, b: 0.98039216, a: 1}
    - Text: 'Since a sticky note can be easily removed without leaving a mark... '
      CharFirstName: Damon
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.75686276, b: 0.98039216, a: 1}
    - Text: "...what I\u2019m doing here shouldn't count as defacing property."
      CharFirstName: Damon
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.75686276, b: 0.98039216, a: 1}
    - Text: If I'm right, and Tozu can see the security camera footage, he'll meet
        me tonight.
      CharFirstName: Damon
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.75686276, b: 0.98039216, a: 1}
    - Text: At least, I hope he affords me that courtesy.
      CharFirstName: Damon
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.75686276, b: 0.98039216, a: 1}
    - Text: ...
      CharFirstName: Damon
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.75686276, b: 0.98039216, a: 1}
    - Text: "Until then\u2026I may as well find something to pass the time."
      CharFirstName: Damon
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.75686276, b: 0.98039216, a: 1}
    - Text: But, what should I do?
      CharFirstName: Damon
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.75686276, b: 0.98039216, a: 1}
    - Text: 'Welcome to <gradient="HitText">Free Time Events!</gradient> '
      CharFirstName: Tutorial
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.27776733, g: 0.735849, b: 0.1365254, a: 255}
    - Text: During Free Time Events, or <gradient="HitText">FTEs</gradient>, you
        have the opportunity to spend some valuable one-on-one time with your classmates.
      CharFirstName: Tutorial
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.27776733, g: 0.735849, b: 0.1365254, a: 255}
    - Text: Since you haven't made the ...*best*...first impression, it may take
        some convincing before your peers speak to you.
      CharFirstName: Tutorial
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.27776733, g: 0.735849, b: 0.1365254, a: 255}
    - Text: But worry not, for the almighty <gradient="HitText">pachinko machine</gradient>
        is here to help!
      CharFirstName: Tutorial
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.27776733, g: 0.735849, b: 0.1365254, a: 255}
    - Text: In case you don't remember, the pachinko machine can be found inside
        the pharmacy.
      CharFirstName: Tutorial
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.27776733, g: 0.735849, b: 0.1365254, a: 255}
    - Text: If you win a round of pachinko, you will be awarded a special currency
        called <gradient="HitText">Marabucks</gradient>.
      CharFirstName: Tutorial
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.27776733, g: 0.735849, b: 0.1365254, a: 255}
    - Text: Marabucks can be spent at the adjacent <gradient="HitText">gachapon</gradient>
        to obtain a present.
      CharFirstName: Tutorial
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.27776733, g: 0.735849, b: 0.1365254, a: 255}
    - Text: Gift your peer a present they like, and they might talk to you!
      CharFirstName: Tutorial
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.27776733, g: 0.735849, b: 0.1365254, a: 255}
    - Text: To view your presents, simply call up your Tozu Trinket and select the
        "Presents" tab.
      CharFirstName: Tutorial
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.27776733, g: 0.735849, b: 0.1365254, a: 255}
    - Text: Within the "Presents" menu, a chart displaying the preferences of your
        peers has been provided.
      CharFirstName: Tutorial
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.27776733, g: 0.735849, b: 0.1365254, a: 255}
    - Text: A green arrow indicates a student will either <gradient="HitText">Like</gradient>
        or <gradient="HitText">Love</gradient> a present...
      CharFirstName: Tutorial
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.27776733, g: 0.735849, b: 0.1365254, a: 255}
    - Text: A red arrow indicates a student will either <gradient="HitText">Dislike</gradient>
        or <gradient="HitText">Hate</gradient> a present...
      CharFirstName: Tutorial
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.27776733, g: 0.735849, b: 0.1365254, a: 255}
    - Text: ...and *no* arrow means the student will feel <gradient="HitText">Neutral</gradient>
        towards the present.
      CharFirstName: Tutorial
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.27776733, g: 0.735849, b: 0.1365254, a: 255}
    - Text: The more a student likes a present, the more likely they are to hang
        out with you!
      CharFirstName: Tutorial
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.27776733, g: 0.735849, b: 0.1365254, a: 255}
    - Text: By the way, you've been gifted <gradient="HitText">10 Marabucks</gradient>
        to start with. Just thought you should know that.
      CharFirstName: Tutorial
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.27776733, g: 0.735849, b: 0.1365254, a: 255}
    - Text: That's about it! Have fun!
      CharFirstName: Tutorial
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.27776733, g: 0.735849, b: 0.1365254, a: 255}
    - Text: Are you sure you want to leave?
      CharFirstName: Damon
      AliasNum: -1
      Charfile: {fileID: 0}
      Voice: 
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.75686276, b: 0.98039216, a: 1}
